[Title: Guitar, Solitude, and the Blue Planet]

70
00:17:17,011 --> 00:17:22,011
突然古いギター取り出し くだらないあーあー
Suddenly pulling out an old guitar, singing nonsense, ah-ah...

71
00:17:22,411 --> 00:17:27,011
空の呼吸 聞こえないかしらの
